            "text": "Yes. How many adults?",
            "next": "n2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n2",
        "partner_line": "Return, please. How much is it?",
        "translation": "Ida y vuelta, por favor. ¿Cuánto cuesta?",
